Marzban Node Installer

This repository contains generic node provisioning scripts and synthetic tests.
It does not contain a panel deployment, operator credentials, or user databases.

Marzban and Marzban-node are upstream projects maintained by Gozargah:
https://github.com/Gozargah/Marzban
https://github.com/Gozargah/Marzban-node

